# Voice product requirements

- Source of truth: `AGENTS.md` at the repo root.
- When the user adds, changes, or rejects a requirement in chat, update `AGENTS.md` before implementing.
- Do not invent product behavior for open questions (`Q-*`) or `proposed` items unless asked to build.
- Prefer accepted requirements; keep IDs, status, and the change log accurate.
